Knowledge Records Search Tool — EMA Knowledge Management prototype

This repository is an information-discovery prototype. It is not an official replacement for the Environmental Management Authority website, the Institute of Marine Affairs Library, another issuing institution's repository, or any formal access/regulatory process.

The tool indexes EMA records and selected related national, regional, international, media, statistical and dataset sources for discovery. Source attribution and access pathways should be retained. IMA-held records must retain Institute of Marine Affairs attribution and, where no public file is available, direct users to the IMA Library/request pathway.

Descriptions, classifications, keywords, charts, media groupings, map associations and related-record suggestions are discovery aids only. Consult the original authoritative source for formal reliance.
